$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$ CR 39 $$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$

$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$ FLUENCIA PROMEDIO EN CADA LAMINA CR-39 $$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$

[T-Track]

title = Proton fluence in CR39 layers

$ Mide la fluencia promedio de protones dentro de cada lamina de CR-39.
$ Permite comparar:
$ lamina 1 -> lamina 2 -> ... -> lamina 8

mesh = reg

reg = 7001 7002 7003 7004 7005 7006 7007 7008

volume
reg     vol
7001    1
7002    1
7003    1
7004    1
7005    1
7006    1
7007    1
7008    1

part = proton

e-type = 2
ne = 1
emin = 1.0e-9
emax = 25.0

unit = 1
axis = reg

file = ./out/flujo_CR39_reg.out
epsout = 1

$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$ MAPAS DE FLUENCIA EN LAS 8 LAMINAS CR-39 $$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$

[T-Track]

title = Proton fluence maps through CR39

$ Mide la distribucion espacial de fluencia de protones en las 8 laminas.
$ Cada bin en z corresponde a una lamina:
$
$ z-bin 1 = lamina 1 : 98.380 - 98.405 cm
$ z-bin 2 = lamina 2 : 98.405 - 98.430 cm
$ z-bin 3 = lamina 3 : 98.430 - 98.455 cm
$ z-bin 4 = lamina 4 : 98.455 - 98.480 cm
$ z-bin 5 = lamina 5 : 98.480 - 98.505 cm
$ z-bin 6 = lamina 6 : 98.505 - 98.530 cm
$ z-bin 7 = lamina 7 : 98.530 - 98.555 cm
$ z-bin 8 = lamina 8 : 98.555 - 98.580 cm

mesh = xyz

x-type = 2
nx = 27
xmin = -1.35
xmax =  1.35

y-type = 2
ny = 32
ymin = -1.3185
ymax =  1.8815

z-type = 2
nz = 8
zmin = 98.380
zmax = 98.580

part = proton

e-type = 2
ne = 1
emin = 1.0e-9
emax = 25.0

unit = 1
axis = xy

file = ./out/flujo_CR39_xyz.out
epsout = 1

$ Medimos dosis: 

[ T - D e p o s i t ]   $ histograma dosis-volumen CR39 + gel

title = Histograma
mesh = xyz
x-type = 2
xmin = -1.7500
xmax = 1.7500
nx = 35
y-type = 2
ymin = -1.3185
ymax = 1.8815
ny = 32
z-type = 2
zmin = 98.330
zmax = 98.580
nz = 10
part = proton
output = dose
unit = 0
axis = z
file = ./out/histograma_dosis_CR39.out
epsout = 1


$ Pico de Bragg (SOBP)

[ T - D e p o s i t ]  $ dosis depositada en profundidad
title = Bragg peak in cr
mesh = r-z
r-type = 2
rmin = 0.0
rmax = 0.5
nr = 1
z-type = 2 
zmin = 97
zmax = 100           
nz = 300                    
part = proton
output = dose
unit = 0
axis = z
file = ./out/bragg_cr.out
epsout = 1


$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$ CORRIENTE A TRAVES DEL CR-39 $$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$

[T-Cross]

title = Proton current through CR39

$ Mide la corriente total de protones que atraviesa cada interfaz:
$ gel -> lamina 1 -> lamina 2 -> ... -> lamina 8 -> PLA

mesh = reg

reg = 9
r-from     r-to        area
600        7001        1     $ Gel -> lamina 1
7001       7002        1     $ Lamina 1 -> lamina 2
7002       7003        1     $ Lamina 2 -> lamina 3
7003       7004        1     $ Lamina 3 -> lamina 4
7004       7005        1     $ Lamina 4 -> lamina 5
7005       7006        1     $ Lamina 5 -> lamina 6
7006       7007        1     $ Lamina 6 -> lamina 7
7007       7008        1     $ Lamina 7 -> lamina 8
7008       6003        1     $ Lamina 8 -> PLA (trampolin)

part = proton

e-type = 2
ne = 1
emin = 1.0e-9
emax = 25.0

output = f-curr
unit = 1
axis = reg

file = ./out/corriente_CR39.out
epsout = 1

$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$ ESPECTROS A TRAVES DEL CR-39 $$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$

[T-Cross]

title = Proton energy spectra through CR39

$ Mide el espectro energetico de los protones que atraviesan cada interfaz:
$ permite ver como cambia la energia del haz al atravesar cada lamina

mesh = reg

reg = 9
r-from     r-to        area
600        7001        1     $ Gel -> lamina 1
7001       7002        1     $ Lamina 1 -> lamina 2
7002       7003        1     $ Lamina 2 -> lamina 3
7003       7004        1     $ Lamina 3 -> lamina 4
7004       7005        1     $ Lamina 4 -> lamina 5
7005       7006        1     $ Lamina 5 -> lamina 6
7006       7007        1     $ Lamina 6 -> lamina 7
7007       7008        1     $ Lamina 7 -> lamina 8
7008       6003        1     $ Lamina 8 -> PLA

part = proton

e-type = 2
ne = 100
emin = 1.0e-3
emax = 25.0

output = f-curr
unit = 2
axis = eng

file = ./out/espectros_CR39.out
epsout = 1


